  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are likely to engage with and spread racist conspiracy theories, particularly those who hold anti-Black stereotypes and white supremacist rhetoric. The meme is designed to appeal to people who believe in the false narrative that white people invented the term 'saggin' to mock Black people, and who enjoy racist wordplay that reinforces negative stereotypes about Black cultural expression. The visual of a Black man is used to anchor the racist narrative, and the text is crafted to provoke racial animosity among those who already hold prejudiced views. The audience is likely to be individuals who are susceptible to misinformation and who use such memes to reinforce their existing biases and to demean Black people by suggesting their cultural expression is a result of white manipulation and deceit.",
